<div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;&#8239;</div>

<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The vote required to approve this proposal was the affirmative vote of a majority of the outstanding shares entitled to vote on the proposal. Accordingly, stockholders approved one or more amendments to our Charter to effect (a) one or more reverse splits of the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding shares of capital stock at a ratio of 1-for-5 to 1-for-200, and in the aggregate at a ratio of not more than 1-for-4,000, inclusive, with the exact ratio within such range to be determined by the Board of Directors of the Company at its discretion (the &#8220;<i>Reverse Split</i>&#8221;), and (b) the Reverse Stock Split, if at all, within one year of the date the proposal is approved by stockholders, each subject to the Board's authority to abandon such amendments</div>

<div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</div>

