<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The vote required to approve this proposal was the affirmative vote of a majority of the shares present in person or by proxy and entitled to vote on the proposal. Accordingly, stockholders approved the 2025 Omnibus Equity Incentive Plan.&#160;</div>

<div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</div>

<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Proposal No. 6: Advisory Vote to Approve Executive Compensation (Say-on-Pay Proposal)</i></div>

